  "translation": "A fihla go kgoši, gomme kgoši a re go yena: Mikayahu, a re ye Ramote ya Gileade go lwana, goba re emiše? Gomme a re go yena: Nyakang o atlege, gomme Yahwe o tla e fa seatleng sa kgoši.",
